YunCMS uses one repository and distribution for Community and Premium editions.
Licensing is determined per file, not by which features the UI displays.

* Files explicitly marked LicenseRef-YunCMS-Commercial, including their compiled
  forms, are governed by the YunCMS Premium Commercial License below.
* Other original YunCMS files remain under the MIT License below unless they
  carry a more specific notice. The extensions SDK remains MIT-licensed.
* Third-party notices and licenses remain applicable to their components.
* Previously released MIT versions, including 0.1.47, retain their MIT grants.

Premium implementations are identified by SPDX notices in source files under
packages/core/src/premium/, packages/api/src/premium/ and apps/studio/src/premium/.
Shared feature-policy infrastructure and Community services remain MIT.
The full license texts are reproduced here so this notice is self-contained in
npm packages and container distributions. Individual SPDX license texts also
appear in LICENSES/ in the repository.

